      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RED HOT LIZZIE (2) returned to form with a bang last start, taking out a $75k feature over 1300m at Mackay in a dominant display. Adam Sewell, with three victories from five rides on the mare, re-unites. Has a decent 1200m record so expect her to maintain the outstanding form. LONERGY (10) returned from a two-month lay-off with a desperately close second over 1050m at this track last start, hitting the line with gusto. Gets in light again and the extra 150m can only help. Definite threat. The consistent HEARTONI (1) raced handy all the way and was only just denied over 1000m at Eagle Farm at his latest appearance. This is as far as he likes it but he loves Rocky so a top three finish looks on the cards. PARADE GROUND (7) is racing well without winning and is not out of the contest from the inside gate. TRACK TALE (4) has been a bit plain of late but is a seven-time Rocky winner so leave her out at your peril.",
